OL,3,GNEWSASchool suspensions rise due to
OL,4,Abehaviour, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said verbal abuse,
OL,7,Fthreats towards teachers and physical
OL,8,Fassaults on pupils were also common
OL,9,Freasons for suspensions.
